Subject: [PATCH] goldfish: Delete owner assignment
Message-Id: <efe8b716-2fd7-5311-7843-f5b69c27db95@users.sourceforge.net>
List-Id: <kernel-janitors.vger.kernel.org>
MIME-Version: 1.0
