Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
To: kernel-janitors@vger.kernel.org
Cc: linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, Julia Lawall <julia.lawall@lip6.fr>

From: Markus Elfring <elfring@users.sourceforge.net>
